ent-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_reads_under_sync_contention.py:1-28,70-108,182-223` — Preserve complete-or-loud reads and separate in-process product-deadline versus subprocess liveness bounds. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_reconcile_workflow_no_shallow_rebase.py:1-14,77-92` — Preserve full-history merge and explicit destination refs on ticket fetches. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_apply_bindings.py:1-12` — Preserve one composed runtime and transport forwarding into apply. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_operation_bindings.py:1-17` — Preserve the API contract, frozen scope, selected-provider construction, and transport seam. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_review_as_workflow.py:1-7` — Preserve current executor/workflow behavior and any still-active equivalence check. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_review_regressions.py:1-11` — Preserve rollback, index cleanup, and tracker-root consistency invariants. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_show_no_stall.py:1-10,72-77` — Preserve the short reconverge deadline, complete-or-error result, and the one-round detection rationale if still necessary. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_txn_transient_retry.py:1-19` — Preserve retry of pre-ref `could not parse HEAD` on txn commits and immediate failure for non-transient errors. Consumer: comment-hygiene scan only; no exact-text consumer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the fi